OL,3,AAirbnb hosts can no longer make guests
OL,4,Astrip beds and wash dishes under new
OL,5,Arules
OL,6,
OL,7,FAirbnb has changed its rules to limit
OL,8,Fwhat property hosts may ask guests to
OL,9,Fdo - including when it comes to
OL,10,Fcleaning.
OL,12,FThe updated guidelines state that hosts
OL,13,Fcan now set seven standard house rules
OL,14,Fand can also add other "reasonable"
OL,15,Frequests.
OL,17,FAirbnb states that guests - who are
OL,18,Frequired to pay a cleaning fee - should
OL,19,Fnot be asked to complete tasks normally
OL,20,Fdone by a cleaner, including washing
OL,21,Fdishes and stripping beds.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,112,105,200,300,0,100
