OL,3,AAirbnb hosts can no longer make guests
OL,4,Astrip beds and wash dishes under new
OL,5,Arules
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe new rules will apply to all
OL,8,Freservations booked on or after 20
OL,9,FNovember on the accommodation
OL,10,Fmarketplace.
